  "variant": 5,
  "name": "Стряхнуть",
  "title": "Стряхнуть",
  "prompt": "One beastlike shake-off gesture. Tense the shoulders in a deeper crouch, then give one short controlled left-right body shiver that travels from the heavy head through the hump. The loose torn ears and ragged cloth lag and flap once; the claws flex. Keep the muzzle low and the club tucked firmly against the belly. Let the wobble settle and return to the exact original crouch and hand placement. No weapon swing, strike, biting, stomping, leap, target, projectile or magic effect. Keep both short feet planted at the same spot and the spine deeply hunched, never stand taller or turn around. Preserve the small body size, simple pixel clusters and torn clothing. Fixed camera and scale, transparent background, whole figure and club within the canvas with empty edge margins.",
